deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-10", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 9}]}, {"range": "31932-31941", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 3, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "16612752_87gbwirzm", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "第二周期是“繁荣扩散期”——企业补完库存后，居民开始有钱消费了，所以房价和物价一起涨，经济从“复工”走向“过热”。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "31932-31941", "abstract": "第二库存周期上行期", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "16612752_87gbwirzm", "userVid": 16612752, "topics": [], "createTime": 1772291505, "contextAbstract": "部整理。\n表1-5　第二库存周期上行期：", "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 16612752, "name": "💪高小颠🌚", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Lw3EDhy5TGEe4S7zuHR2umtoibSAlo5dXUUvQqrwyJic3UTjAuADmG1qg8g2obNvR3EJlDCbAsv3w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "💪高小颠🌚", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "书到用时方恨少，事非经过不知难。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "好读书 不求甚解", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "924489631_863goEe5p", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "第二库存周期：在第一周期调整后，再次启动的新一轮库存周期。它的上行期往往更强劲、更持续，因为它通常与更大的宏观经济动力（如房地产周期、资本开支周期）以及更广泛的信心恢复相结合，是经济进入中期繁荣的重要标志\n中国现在正处于的阶段", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "31932-31941", "abstract": "第二库存周期上行期", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "924489631_863goEe5p", "userVid": 924489631, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768035955, "contextAbstract": "部整理。\n表1-5　第二库存周期上行期：", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 924489631, "name": "Maggie zeng", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/1gvL9ficRs1Ex7lOM591Jqia1vBsKtjD2VJhVXZXNpKqw01lA2ic3qz9Q/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}}, "likesCount": 7}, {"reviewId": "924489631_863gMwlg5", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "\n对于投资者：\n· 资产配置偏向权益和周期性资产：\n  · 股票市场：周期股（如工业金属、化工、建材、机械设备）和金融股（银行、券商）通常是这个阶段的领涨板块。因为它们的盈利对价格和需求弹性最大。\n  · 商品市场：工业金属（铜、铝等）、能源等大宗商品价格有强劲支撑。\n  · 债券市场：需警惕，因为经济向好和通胀预期可能推升利率，债券价格承压。\n· 投资风格：从成长确定性转向盈利增长弹性。寻找业绩修复空间大、杠杆效应明显的公司。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "31932-31941", "abstract": "第二库存周期上行期", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "924489631_863gMwlg5", "userVid": 924489631, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768036308, "contextAbstract": "部整理。\n表1-5　第二库存周期上行期：", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 924489631, "name": "Maggie zeng", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/1gvL9ficRs1Ex7lOM591Jqia1vBsKtjD2VJhVXZXNpKqw01lA2ic3qz9Q/0", "